   "evidence": "Mathlib has `Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/BilinearForm/` but no `Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/BilinearForm.lean`; globbing `Mathlib/{Order/Filter.lean,Algebra/Group.lean,Data/Finset.lean,Topology/Separation.lean,Analysis/Analytic.lean,Order/Hom.lean}` in ./upstream/mathlib returns no files \u2014 Mathlib uses `Foo/Basic.lean`. EpsilonEridani likewise has no other `Foo.lean` next to `Foo/` (e.g. `Particles/Parton/Basic.lean`, `QFT/Factorization/Convolution/Basic.lean`). The root-file objection does not hold: lakefile.toml has `globs = [\"EpsilonEridani.*\"]` with the comment \"The root EpsilonEridani.lean re-exports nothing and is intentionally empty \u2014 a PR never has to touch it, and no code imports it\"; grep for `RealTensor.Metrics.LeviCivita` finds only `EpsilonEridani.lean:139` and `LeviCivita/VolumeForm.lean:8` as importers.",
