   "fix": "In this PR, `git mv EpsilonEridani/Relativity/Tensors/RealTensor/Metrics/LeviCivita.lean EpsilonEridani/Relativity/Tensors/RealTensor/Metrics/LeviCivita/Basic.lean` (no declaration renames) and update the two references to the old module path: the `public import` at `LeviCivita/VolumeForm.lean:8` and `EpsilonEridani.lean:139`.",
   "issue": "The PR adds `Metrics/LeviCivita/VolumeForm.lean` while leaving `Metrics/LeviCivita.lean` flat beside the new directory. The placement note justifies this as \"Mathlib's `Foo.lean` + `Foo/Bar.lean` layout\", which Mathlib does not use, and as blocked by the root `EpsilonEridani.lean`, which the lakefile says is not part of the build.",
